<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear {!IndividualApplication.Account},</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Following the review of the application titled </span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">“</b><font face="arial"><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">”</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">, the [Committee/Agency Name] has requested </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">resubmission</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"> with
revisions from the </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">[Location] </b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">WIN-COE.</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">The review feedback outlining the required modifications is
