<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Should you require any assistance during the resubmission
process, please don’t hesitate to reach out to <b>[Name]</b> on <b>[Email ID]</b>
anytime.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your cooperation and commitment to continuous
improvement.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,<br>
